Both D1 and D2 are now green!
I've implemented a basic collision response ( la "naive" correction but with repositioning to prevent D3 and a basic tunneling check for D2).
Wait, D3 (Sticky) and D4 (Corner) were not tested yet.
The current implementation of repositioning:
```javascript
      if (overlapX < overlapY) {
        ball.vx *= -1;
        ball.x += (ball.vx > 0) la ? overlapX : -overlapX;
